{
  "schemaVersion": "presentation-script-v1",
  "title": "Baarah to Care",
  "durationSeconds": 270,
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "opening",
      "speech": {
        "text": "",
        "pause": "normal",
        "presenterNote": "Look at the judges, not the screen. Make eye contact before touching the map."
      },
      "actions": [
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 700 },
        { "type": "wait-for-map-idle" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "baarah-search",
      "speech": {
        "text": "Last year, my mom had a stroke while she was in Haa Alifu Baarah.",
        "pause": "normal"
      },
      "actions": [
        { "type": "click", "target": "island-search" },
        { "type": "input", "target": "island-search", "text": "baar", "textVariants": ["baara", "baar"] },
        { "type": "key", "target": "island-search", "key": "Enter" },
        { "type": "wait-for-target", "target": "island-details-tab" },
        { "type": "wait-for-map-idle" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "baarah-health-centre",
      "speech": {
        "text": "Baarah has a health centre. But that health centre cannot provide all the care my mother needs.",
        "pause": "pause"
      },
      "actions": [
        { "type": "focus-service", "target": "baarah-health-centre" },
        { "type": "wait-for-target", "target": "service-popup" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 450 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "resident-demand",
      "speech": {
        "text": "We estimate that 414 out of 1,141 people need health care outside Baarah. 61 of them are elderly people.",
        "pause": "normal",
        "presenterNote": "Point to the elderly count in Resident demand allocation."
      },
      "actions": [
        { "type": "hover", "target": "resident-demand-elderly" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1100 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mother",
      "speech": {
        "text": "That number is easy to read on a screen. I put a face to it.",
        "pause": "normal",
        "presenterNote": "Look at the judges."
      },
      "actions": [{ "type": "wait", "ms": 900 }]
    },
    {
      "id": "mother-face",
      "speech": {
        "text": "My mother.",
        "pause": "long",
        "presenterNote": "Look at the judges."
      },
      "actions": [{ "type": "wait", "ms": 1000 }]
    },
    {
      "id": "connection-network",
      "speech": {
        "text": "At 7:35, she left Baarah. But she did not go straight to an airport.",
        "pause": "normal"
      },
      "actions": [
        { "type": "click", "target": "connection-network-fullscreen" },
        { "type": "click", "target": "connection-destination-search" },
        { "type": "input", "target": "connection-destination-search", "text": "hulhumal" },
        { "type": "key", "target": "connection-destination-search", "key": "Enter" },
        { "type": "wait-for-target", "target": "connection-network-viewport" },
        { "type": "wait-for-target", "target": "simulate-journey" },
        { "type": "click", "target": "simulate-journey" },
        { "type": "wait-for-journey-section", "sectionId": "ferry-baarah-vashafaru" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ferry-stops",
      "speech": {
        "text": "The ferry took her through Vashafaru first. The ferry continued through Dhihdhoo. Every stop meant waiting for the next connection.",
        "pause": "normal",
        "presenterNote": "Let the route animation play."
      },
      "actions": [{ "type": "wait-for-journey-section", "sectionId": "ferry-vashafaru-dhihdhoo" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "airport",
      "speech": {
        "text": "At 11:00, she boarded another ferry. At 11:25, she finally reached Hanimaadhoo Airport. An airport is not a hospital.",
        "pause": "pause"
      },
      "actions": [{ "type": "wait-for-journey-section", "sectionId": "weather-delay-hanimaadhoo" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "flight",
      "speech": {
        "text": "Then she flew to Hulhule.",
        "pause": "normal"
      },
      "actions": [{ "type": "wait-for-journey-section", "sectionId": "flight-takeoff" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "landing",
      "speech": {
        "text": "When she landed, it was raining.",
        "pause": "pause"
      },
      "actions": [{ "type": "wait-for-journey-section", "sectionId": "flight-landing-handoff" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "tree-top",
      "speech": {
        "text": "After the ferries, the flight, and all that waiting, she still had to stand in a queue for treatment.",
        "pause": "normal",
        "presenterNote": "Point to where connections matter most."
      },
      "actions": [
        { "type": "wait-for-journey-section", "sectionId": "ambulance-tree-top" },
        { "type": "pause-journey" },
        { "type": "focus-service", "target": "tree-top-marker" },
        { "type": "hover", "target": "inbound-care-value" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1000 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gap",
      "speech": {
        "text": "That is the gap in access. Reaching the island is not the same as reaching care.",
        "pause": "long"
      },
      "actions": [
        { "type": "click", "target": "island-analytics-close" },
        { "type": "wait-for-map-idle" },
        { "type": "wait-for-target", "target": "island-search" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "health-demand",
      "speech": {
        "text": "We make that pressure visible. This is not just a route on a map. It is my mother's journey. It is the ferries, the airport, the waiting, and the care she was still trying to reach. We make that whole chain visible.",
        "pause": "normal",
        "presenterNote": "Point to the Health demand percentage."
      },
      "actions": [
        { "type": "click", "target": "island-search" },
        { "type": "input", "target": "island-search", "text": "baar", "textVariants": ["baara", "baar"] },
        { "type": "key", "target": "island-search", "key": "Enter" },
        { "type": "click", "target": "island-details-tab" },
        { "type": "wait-for-tab", "target": "island-details-tab" },
        { "type": "scroll", "target": "health-demand-card", "amount": 420 },
        { "type": "hover", "target": "health-demand-percent", "cursorOffset": [0, 16] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "chain-visible",
      "speech": {
        "text": "Not to make the journey look simple. To show where it becomes difficult.",
        "pause": "long"
      },
      "actions": [{ "type": "wait", "ms": 1000 }]
    },
    {
      "id": "national-pattern",
      "speech": {
        "text": "My mother is one person. But the data shows that this problem is bigger than one family. Baarah is not the only island where demand and access are out of balance.",
        "pause": "long",
        "presenterNote": "Look at the judges."
      },
      "actions": [
        { "type": "click", "target": "island-analytics-close" },
        { "type": "wait-for-map-idle" },
        { "type": "click", "target": "national-score-details" },
        { "type": "wait-for-target", "target": "national-analytics-close" },
        { "type": "scroll", "target": "high-inbound-demand", "amount": 360 },
        { "type": "hover", "target": "high-inbound-demand" },
        { "type": "scroll", "target": "most-inaccessible-islands", "amount": 320 },
        { "type": "hover", "target": "most-inaccessible-islands" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "proposal-start",
      "speech": {
        "text": "That is what we are building: a way to see the gap before another family has to live through it. Let us test a proposal to help this scenario.",
        "pause": "normal"
      },
      "actions": [
        { "type": "click", "target": "national-analytics-close" },
        { "type": "wait-for-target", "target": "island-search" },
        { "type": "click", "target": "island-search" },
        { "type": "input", "target": "island-search", "text": "baar", "textVariants": ["baara", "baar"] },
        { "type": "key", "target": "island-search", "key": "Enter" },
        { "type": "click", "target": "create-proposal" },
        { "type": "wait-for-proposal-state", "state": "ready" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "proposal-recommendation",
      "speech": {
        "text": "We could upgrade the health centre in Baarah to a hospital. But before we spend that money, our data wizards double-check the choice.",
        "pause": "normal",
        "presenterNote": "Look at the judges while the recommendation loads."
      },
      "actions": [
        { "type": "focus-service", "target": "baarah-health-centre" },
        { "type": "wait-for-target", "target": "service-popup" },
        { "type": "click", "target": "upgrade-service" },
        { "type": "wait-for-recommendation" },
        { "type": "click", "target": "recommendation-card" },
        { "type": "wait-for-target", "target": "apply-recommended-changes" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "proposal-apply",
      "speech": {
        "text": "Our data wizards found a better idea: add a reverse ferry route and recalculate the network.",
        "pause": "normal"
      },
      "actions": [
        { "type": "click", "target": "apply-recommended-changes" },
        { "type": "wait-for-proposal-state", "state": "settled" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "proposal-download",
      "speech": {
        "text": "With one additional ferry, we do not have to spend huge amounts upgrading a health centre for 61 people. We reduce the journey time and save a huge sum of money.",
        "pause": "long"
      },
      "actions": [
        { "type": "wait-for-proposal-state", "state": "settled" },
        { "type": "hover", "target": "proposal-title" },
        { "type": "scroll", "target": "download-proposal", "amount": 420 },
        { "type": "click", "target": "download-proposal" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
